    "expectedRule": "Arena combat openings record the style of the first attack/art/guard action of each non-boss combat victory: force (attack), art, or guard. Two consecutive victories with the same opening style apply a -20% penalty to that style's outgoing damage or guard effect. Once all three styles have at least one victory, the ruling is rewritten to +10% force/art outgoing damage and +10% guard effect. Route gates arena_force_champion_lane, arena_art_bench_lane, and arena_guard_oath_lane open after at least one victory with their respective style; arena_three_style_judge_lane opens only after all three styles have won. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
